SUMMARY:Easy run 5 km (talk test)
DESCRIPTION:Easy run 5 km (talk test)\n\nWeek 1 of 10 - Base\nKeep HR und
 er 158. Walk the climbs. Talk test.\nRe-entry. Madeira's 2\,003 m of des
 cent is an eccentric-damage event - strength markers return to baseline 
 around day 9 and muscle damage is detectable up to 4 weeks. NO lunges\, 
 NO burpee broad jumps\, NO heavy sled this week or next: those are preci
 sely the movements your quads cannot absorb yet. Ergs\, grip and techniq
 ue only. SWIMMING STARTS NOW. Swim frequency beats swim volume: 4 x 30-4
 0 min beats 2 x 75\, because fatigue compromises motor learning. Never l
 et a gap exceed 5 days - adult-onset swimmers lose motor patterns fast. 
 Book private lessons NOW for weeks 1-8.\n69 days to HYROX Amsterdam Doub
 les.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
