DTSTAMP:20260818T140829Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261213
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261214
SUMMARY:▲ Long easy run 14 km
DESCRIPTION:Long easy run 14 km\n\nWeek 5 of 10 - Build\nKeep HR under 15
 8. Walk the climbs. Talk test.\nPriority order from 182k measured double
 s teams: running (r=0.90 with finish) > roxzone > lunges/burpees/sled pu
 ll. Wall balls correlate r=0.266 - the LOWEST of any segment in doubles.
  Do not spend training on them. Cold immersions start this week and run 
 through February - 5-6 short exposures halve the cold-shock response\, w
 hich is the mechanism behind most swim DNFs and 90 of 120 recorded sudde
 n deaths in US triathlon.\n41 days to HYROX Amsterdam Doubles.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
