DTSTAMP:20260818T140829Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270117
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270118
SUMMARY:Easy shakeout 5 km
DESCRIPTION:Easy shakeout 5 km\n\nWeek 10 of 10 - Race\nKeep HR under 158
 . Walk the climbs. Talk test.\nRACE WEEK. Target 88-95 min\, NOT 80-85 -
  measured doubles station totals are 28:23\, not the 25 I first assumed\
 , so the 80-85 band actually needs 5:47/km over 8 compromised reps. TACT
 ICS: (1) expect R8 to be your slowest run at every level - it is for eve
 ryone\; (2) a controlled 12-15% positive split is optimal\, even pacing 
 is NOT a lever (measured dR2 = 0.000)\; (3) never let the sled stop - at
  56 kg you pay the breakaway cost every restart\; (4) grippy solid-rubbe
 r shoes are worth 30-60 s on the sled\; (5) don't chase wall balls\, fle
 x that split to whoever is holding up.\n6 days to HYROX Amsterdam Double
 s.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
